{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10132010","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10132010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1013201001:0":{"text":"저는 어릴 때부터 마을에서 자랐어요. 성당에서 배포한 『듀라 여신의 기록』이 제가 본 책 중에 가장 글자가 많은 책이었죠.","source_cn":"我从小生长在村子里。见过字最多的一本书，是圣堂派发的《...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x383AC97E1447014B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013201002:0":{"text":"그런데 상록수 학회 영지에 가니 책이 정말 많더라고요. 그리고 복잡해 보이는 기구들도 많았고요...","source_cn":"直到第一次进冬青学会的营地，看到那么多书，那么多复杂的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F3A6D30208F2A40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013201003:0":{"text":"하, 정말로 꿈만 같았어요...","source_cn":"哈，简直像做梦一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2C43E9A64C72DC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:梅瑞特":{"text":"메린","source":"梅瑞特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}